# Butler Routes - Zephras Isle completionist pilot (pack butler-routes-completionist, v0.1.2).
# Every Zephras Isle quest in the WoW Forever command center's tracker list
# (145 quests, incl. the three spawn quests 92460-92462 restored 2026-11-13)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin.
# Class and order (faction) quests for other classes/orders are included and
# gated with 'only', so they never show for a character they are not for.
# Same-name order pairs (Welcome to Shen'dar Village, To Valanaar, In Service
# of Zephras, A Grand Adventure, What Comes Next, The Fate of Zephras,
# Confront Lorthuna) are co-located: take the version your order offers.
# Coordinates typed in this guide are in the client's own (live) map frame.
guide butler-routes-completionist/zephras-isle
title Zephras Isle - Completionist (Skyborne)
levels 1-12
zone Zephras Isle
faction Alliance
race Skyborne
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords zephras, completionist, skyborne, all quests, orinis
coords live
version 3

step Thendal Village - arrival

  tip You appear in Thendal Village. Ailee Farheart (42.8, 23.4) stands beside you with the first quest every Skyborne takes; it leads you to Rorian the Dayseeker (42.1, 23.5), who runs the village. Take every quest a person offers before you head out.
  note If a golden vuldren crosses your path anywhere on Zephras Isle, that is Slydris, the rare golden fox. Tame him if you are a hunter of level 10 or more. Foxes cannot learn Growl yet, so he is a trophy for the stable, not a tank.
  accept 92460 -- Ailee Farheart - Coming of Age
  turnin 92460 -- Hand it to Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92461 -- Rorian the Dayseeker - Harmony in Balance (slay 8 Juvenile Vuldren, south of the village)
  accept 92464 -- Rorian the Dayseeker - Elemental Unrest
  accept 92462 -- Elatrell Featherlight (43.4, 24.8) - Infestation Investigation (slay 8 Pesky Cirrusflies, alongside the Queen)
  accept 92463 -- Elatrell Featherlight (43.4, 24.8) - The Cirrusfly Queen
  accept 94414 -- Halaan Hawk-Eye (43.8, 24.1) - The Anchors of Zephras
  accept 92474 -- Myriaal Mistwake (43.7, 24.1) - Falling With Style

step Thendal Village - your class introduction

  tip Hand Harmony in Balance to Rorian; at level 2 he gives every class its first lesson. Only your own class's quest is offered to you; the other lines simply never appear.
