  accept 92481 only Mage -- A Student of the Arcane - Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92482 only Hunter -- The Way of the Hunter - Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92483 only Rogue -- At Home in the Shadows - Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92484 only Shaman -- Embracing the Elements - Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92485 only Druid -- A Student of Nature - Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92532 only Warrior -- The Warrior's Path - Rorian the Dayseeker
  turnin 92481 only Mage
  turnin 92482 only Hunter
  turnin 92483 only Rogue
  turnin 92484 only Shaman
  turnin 92485 only Druid
  turnin 92532 only Warrior

