step Thendal Grove - the den mother

  tip Aetheen of the Gales has the last Thendal work. Both quests are handed in to Constable Aonda in Shen'dar Village, so keep them for the road south.
  level 5
  accept 92470 -- Foul Matriarch - Aetheen of the Gales
  accept 92472 -- The Next Step - Aetheen of the Gales

step The road south

  tip On the road south to Shen'dar Village, Hanaa Nightwind (38.4, 30.1) has work: Al'Aketh cultists infest the ruins to the south-west.
  accept 92544 -- Al'Aketh Thugs - Hanaa Nightwind
  turnin 92544

step Shen'dar Village - arrival

  tip Report to Constable Aonda (45.6, 45.5). Make the inn your home while you are here: innkeeper Coriella Calmbreeze stands at 43.0, 43.3.
  turnin 92470 -- Foul Matriarch - hand in to Constable Aonda
  turnin 92472 -- The Next Step - report to Constable Aonda
  accept 92514 -- Welcome to Shen'dar Village - one of the two versions is your order's; take the one Aonda offers
  accept 93461 -- Welcome to Shen'dar Village - the other order's version; it will not be offered to you
  accept 92517 -- The Criminal Element - Constable Aonda
  accept 96101 -- The Great Outdoors - the Shen'dar camp
  accept 96638 -- The Adventurer

step Shen'dar Village - a gatherer's toolkit

  tip Shen'dar holds the island's profession trainers. Messana Crestwind (44.8, 44.5) teaches Mining; Halassa Fernbreeze (43.0, 43.5) teaches Herbalism. These two lines are the reason this pack exists - a gatherer's route. They are optional: skip them if gathering is not your plan.
  train Mining optional
  train Herbalism optional

step Shen'dar Village - Camping 101

  tip The camp's Camping 101 quests each teach one profession's basics and are offered once you have learned that profession (Tailoring and Enchanting each have a second, specialisation version). Take the ones you qualify for as you learn professions around the island; the rest are optional and safe to skip.
