step Valanaar - arrival

  tip Valanaar, the island's capital. Report to Valennia Stormfist (66.2, 76.6) and deliver the Shadowsong signet. The inn is Donaal Downbreeze's (62.2, 72.7) - bind your hearthstone here.
  turnin 92579 -- To Valanaar - deliver Aonda's report to Valennia Stormfist
  turnin 92701 -- To Valanaar - the other order's version ends here too
  turnin 93948 -- Deliver the Signet - to Talaanis Shadowsong
