step Windfield Orchard

  tip Aamelia Windfield's orchard, in the Gustberry Lowlands. Bandits, flutterflies and galestriders - and keep an eye out for a certain rare tallstrider.
  task "Camp Fernfeather, the rare level 10 tallstrider - she walks the orchard (about 52.6, 81.2 and 48.0, 85.4). Tame her; do not kill her." optional
