step Valanaar - the taming chain (Hunter, level 10)

  only Hunter
  tip A hunter's pet, in five quests. Elayaa Easewind, your Shen'dar trainer, sends you to Quel'ana Quickgale in Valanaar (59.6, 72.6). The three quests all named Taming the Beast run in order - Windsong Crawler, Ornery Galestrider, Vuldren Alpha - each with the Taming Rod she gives you.
  level 10
