step Shrine of Akir - the confrontation

  tip The end of the island's story. Valennia Stormfist waits in the Gustberry Lowlands to begin the move on the Shrine; Hyusaa Quickbreeze holds the Shrine itself. Warriors: Zaal Stormshield, who holds the Skybreaker Bulwark, is here too.
