step Leaving Zephras Isle

  tip When you are ready, your order's leader sends you on. The skycutter sails from the Valanaar Skydocks: to Dalaran for the Alliance, to Mulgore for the Horde. The last two quests are handed in where you land.
  accept 93089 -- What Comes Next - one of the two versions is your order's
  accept 93090 -- What Comes Next - the other order's version; it will not be offered to you
  turnin 93089
  turnin 93090
  accept 94946 only Alliance -- The Magical City of Dalaran - the skycutter to Dalaran
  accept 95349 only Horde -- The Earthen Ring - the skycutter to Mulgore
  turnin 94946 only Alliance -- Hand in to Danaaris Stargale when you land in Dalaran
  turnin 95349 only Horde -- Hand in to Alana Stormwalker in Mulgore
